<h1 class="govuk-heading-l">GOV.UK Design System + Golang + Gin</h1>
<p class="govuk-body">Using Go keeps the server fast, easy to deploy as a single binary, and straightforward to maintain with a strong standard library.</p>
<p class="govuk-body">Gin provides simple routing and middleware, so you can build handlers quickly whilst still keeping performance and request handling predictable.</p>
<p class="govuk-body">Go’s compiled concurrency model helps you handle many requests efficiently with low overhead. That makes it a good fit for services that need consistent response times under load.</p>
<p class="govuk-body">Together they make it easy to serve GOV.UK Frontend components and assets from one application without a separate frontend build pipeline.</p>
